{"seq":1,"slug":"daylighting-principles","title":"天然采光原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/daylighting-principles","wordCount":1367,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"天然采光原理\">天然采光原理</h1><p>阴天正午，靠窗的座位能轻松读书，房间深处却要开灯——同一片天空，光照进室内后会随距窗距离急剧衰减。天然采光研究的就是这套&quot;室外天空光如何变成室内可用照度&quot;的规律。它是免费、健康、随时间动态变化的光源，把它用好是绿色建筑的第一步，但日光从不单独到来，它总裹挟着热量，所以采光从一开始就是和得热、能耗的博弈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-采光系数与天空模型\">核心概念：采光系数与天空模型</h2><p>室外照度时刻在变（晴天可达十万勒克斯，阴天仅几千），用绝对照度评价室内采光会随天气漂移。建筑光学因此引入一个无量纲的相对量——<strong>采光系数 DF（Daylight Factor）</strong>：室内某点照度与同一时刻室外无遮挡水平照度之比。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DF = \\frac{E_{in}}{E_{out}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>DF 之所以稳定，是因为它建立在<strong>全云天空（CIE Overcast Sky）</strong> 假设上——阴天天空亮度分布与天气无关，天顶亮度约为地平线的三倍。室内一点的 DF 由三部分相加：直接看到天空的<strong>天空分量（SC）</strong>、室外地物反射进来的<strong>外反射分量（ERC）</strong>、室内墙顶地多次反射的<strong>内反射分量（IRC）</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Sky[全云天空 CIE Overcast] --&gt; SC[天空分量 SC&lt;br/&gt;直接见天]&#10;  Sky --&gt; Ext[室外地面/邻栋] --&gt; ERC[外反射分量 ERC]&#10;  SC --&gt; P((室内某点照度))&#10;  ERC --&gt; P&#10;  P --&gt; IRC[内反射分量 IRC&lt;br/&gt;室内表面多次反射]&#10;  IRC --&gt; P\">flowchart TD\n  Sky[全云天空 CIE Overcast] --&gt; SC[天空分量 SC&lt;br/&gt;直接见天]\n  Sky --&gt; Ext[室外地面/邻栋] --&gt; ERC[外反射分量 ERC]\n  SC --&gt; P((室内某点照度))\n  ERC --&gt; P\n  P --&gt; IRC[内反射分量 IRC&lt;br/&gt;室内表面多次反射]\n  IRC --&gt; P</pre><p>我国《建筑采光设计标准》GB 50033-2013 按建筑类型规定采光系数标准值，例如普通办公、教室要求侧面采光 DF 不低于一定限值（来源：<a href=\"http://www.jianbiaoku.com/webarbs/book/50/2440035.shtml\">GB 50033-2013 建标库</a>）。需要注意，DF 基于阴天假设，无法反映晴天直射、朝向与全年动态——这正是后文动态指标补位的地方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评价指标</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采光系数 DF</td>\n<td>室内/室外照度比（阴天）</td>\n<td>稳定、易合规</td>\n<td>忽略朝向、晴天、动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采光均匀度</td>\n<td>最小/平均照度</td>\n<td>反映明暗对比</td>\n<td>不含眩光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sDA（空间日照自主性）</td>\n<td>全年达标时间面积比</td>\n<td>动态、真实</td>\n<td>需逐时模拟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASE（年日照暴露）</td>\n<td>过亮面积比</td>\n<td>控制过曝/眩光风险</td>\n<td>需逐时模拟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"采光口形式-侧窗-天窗与导光\">采光口形式：侧窗、天窗与导光</h2><p>光从哪里进来，决定了室内光分布的形态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>侧面采光（侧窗）</strong>：最常见，靠墙开窗。优点是有视野、施工简单；缺点是照度随进深快速衰减，一般有效进深约为窗高的 2–2.5 倍，房间深处需人工补光。</li>\n<li><strong>顶部采光（天窗）</strong>：屋顶开口，照度均匀、进深不限，适合大空间（厂房、中庭、博物馆）；缺点是夏季太阳得热大、易眩光、防水难。</li>\n<li><strong>导光系统</strong>：导光管、反光板（light shelf）、棱镜等把日光&quot;搬&quot;进深处。反光板装在窗上部，把光反射到顶棚再漫射到室内深处，既增深处照度又遮上部直射眩光。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"窗墙比-采光-得热-能耗的三角权衡\">窗墙比：采光、得热、能耗的三角权衡</h2><p>窗户越大采光越好，但窗户的传热系数远高于墙体（见 <a href=\"heat-transfer-and-envelope\">传热与建筑围护结构热工</a>），又是太阳得热的主入口。<strong>窗墙比（WWR）</strong> 因此成为统揽三方的关键设计变量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>采光视角：WWR 越大，进光越多，但边际效益递减且过大易眩光。</li>\n<li>热工视角：WWR 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{trans}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，这笔账记在 <a href=\"building-energy-balance\">建筑能量平衡与能耗</a> 的围护传热项。</li>\n<li>得热视角：WWR 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{sol}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，夏季成负担、冬季南向成福利。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最优 WWR 不存在普适值，必须按气候区、朝向、玻璃性能联合求解。一个常见结论是：在保证采光达标前提下尽量压低 WWR，并用高光热比（LSG）玻璃&quot;只放光不放热&quot;——玻璃同时影响这里的采光和能量平衡篇的 SHGC，是两篇共享的设计杠杆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态采光与日光控制-从合规到性能\">动态采光与日光控制：从合规到性能</h2><p>DF 是静态合规指标，但真实日光随时辰、季节、朝向剧烈变化。当代绿色建筑评价（如 LEED、WELL）转向<strong>动态采光指标</strong>：<strong>sDA（空间日照自主性）</strong> 衡量全年有多大比例的工作面在多少时间内仅靠日光即达标，<strong>ASE（年日照暴露）</strong> 则约束过亮面积以防眩光与过热。这两个指标需要逐时日光模拟，其工具链（如 Radiance）属于 <a href=\"../air-moisture-frontiers/performance-simulation-digital\">建筑性能模拟与数字化</a> 的范畴。</p>\n<p>把动态采光落地，靠<strong>日光联动控制</strong>：照度传感器感知室内日光，自动调暗或关闭人工灯具（daylight harvesting），实现日光与电光的无缝接力。这套接力的电光一侧，是 <a href=\"artificial-lighting-design\">人工照明设计</a> 的主题；而过亮带来的眩光风险，由 <a href=\"glare-and-visual-comfort\">眩光与视觉舒适</a> 专门处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>天然采光用无量纲的采光系数 DF 评价，基于全云天空假设，由天空分量、外反射、内反射三部分相加。</li>\n<li>DF 稳定易合规但忽略朝向与动态，sDA/ASE 等动态指标更真实，需逐时模拟。</li>\n<li>采光口分侧窗、天窗、导光系统三类，分别决定室内光分布形态与得热眩光特性。</li>\n<li>窗墙比是采光、热损失、太阳得热的三角权衡变量，最优值随气候朝向而定，高光热比玻璃可&quot;只放光不放热&quot;。</li>\n<li>动态采光靠日光联动控制与人工照明接力，过亮风险交由眩光篇处理，模拟工具链见数字化篇。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"天然采光原理","id":"天然采光原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：采光系数与天空模型","id":"核心概念-采光系数与天空模型"},{"level":2,"text":"采光口形式：侧窗、天窗与导光","id":"采光口形式-侧窗-天窗与导光"},{"level":2,"text":"窗墙比：采光、得热、能耗的三角权衡","id":"窗墙比-采光-得热-能耗的三角权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"动态采光与日光控制：从合规到性能","id":"动态采光与日光控制-从合规到性能"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"建筑能量平衡与能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/building-energy-balance"},"next":{"title":"人工照明设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/artificial-lighting-design"}}